   (GRET), ELECTR NETWORK, OCT 10-11, 2020},
Abstract = {There is an important relationship between the valve system and the
   engine's power, economy, and emissions. If the valve system is designed
   unreasonable, it will have quite large influence on the engine's
   charging efficiency, which reduces a decrease in power, insufficient
   power, and worsen emissions. Therefore, a good valve system can improve
   engine performance while meeting higher charging efficiency. This paper
   uses the 3D modeling software UG to establish model of the valve system
   of a gasoline engine firstly. Then it is established that the valve
   system kinematics and dynamics simulation model combined with
   AVL\_EXCITE. According to the analysis of the relative movement of the
   cam profile under the rated power of the gasoline engine, referring to
   the evaluation index, the deficiency is found and the optimization
   scheme is proposed.},
