Organization = {Int Journal Appl Energy; Appl Energy Innovat Inst; China Assoc Sci \&
   Technol HOME Program; Malardalen Univ, Future Energy Profile},
Abstract = {Thermal and energy saving performance of a new designed shell-and-tube
   condenser equipped with a liquid separator is experimentally studied.
   The aim is to timely discharge the condensate, delay the formation of
   condensed liquid film, and enhance the heat transfer performance. The
   tested results of the new designed condenser are compared with the
   traditional one. The experimental results indicate that the heat
   transfer efficiency of the new proposed condenser can be improved by
   about 30\%. The new structure of the condenser can be used to improve
   the energy efficiency of the overall thermal system, and achieve the aim
   of energy saving. (C) 2016 The Authors. Published by Elsevier Ltd.},
