   13-15, 2016},
Organization = {Int Journal Appl Energy; Appl Energy Innovat Inst; China Assoc Sci \&
   Technol HOME Program; Malardalen Univ, Future Energy Profile},
Abstract = {The condenser is widely used in the field of HVAC\&R, thermal energy and
   petrochemical engineering. The improvement of heat transfer efficiency
   can lead to the overall system energy efficiency increase, so the
   operating cost is reduced. This study focuses on condensation heat
   transfer process of R245fa with 4.38mm horizontal tube. It is shown from
   test results that the changing rate of heat transfer coefficient for
   R245fa is normally same in the different condensation temperature. The
   peak of heat transfer coefficient exists with the quality increasing at
   the large mass flow condition. And heat transfer coefficient increases
   with quality increasing at small mass flow conditions. High efficiency
   of condenser can be designed by the experiment results. In addition, the
   enhancement of the heat transfer can also reduce the required heat
   transfer area. And consequently, the initial cost is decreasing. (C)
   2016 The Authors. Published by Elsevier Ltd.},
