   Seangklieng, Khiensak and Witchayangkoon, Boonsap and Syahbana, Joesron
   Alie},
Title = {Analysis on Urban Paths and Edges at Farlim Township in Penang},
Journal = {INTERNATIONAL TRANSACTION JOURNAL OF ENGINEERING MANAGEMENT \& APPLIED
   SCIENCES \& TECHNOLOGIES},
